WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:04.300
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.300 --> 00:07.140
Become entwined in chains

00:07.140 --> 00:10.570
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.570 --> 00:14.940
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.940 --> 00:21.080
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.350 --> 00:26.620
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.420 --> 00:32.690
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.500 --> 00:38.990
Just one life that is out there

00:40.500 --> 00:45.770
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.570 --> 00:52.350
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.350 --> 00:58.690
Must surely exist

00:58.690 --> 01:01.960
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.960 --> 01:04.890
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.890 --> 01:08.230
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.230 --> 01:12.600
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.600 --> 01:17.000
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:31.120 --> 01:35.160
Vice-captain, can I show
the comet's image on the monitor?

01:35.160 --> 01:36.150
Sure.

01:41.900 --> 01:45.300
Hey, what color goes better over here?

01:52.340 --> 01:54.680
Ezra, give me the comet's data.

01:54.680 --> 01:55.710
Vice-captain!

01:55.710 --> 01:57.770
Which one do you think is cuter?

01:58.910 --> 02:00.720
Pick the one you like.

02:00.720 --> 02:02.380
What now? I can't choose!

02:06.860 --> 02:08.190
Captain!

02:09.690 --> 02:15.830
Well, Christmas couldn't start
unless I became Santa, right?

02:15.830 --> 02:19.100
- Captain, you look cute!
- That looks great on you!

02:34.050 --> 02:37.620
Barnette, put more
chocolate cream on it.

02:37.620 --> 02:40.020
And don't forget the powdered sugar.

02:43.830 --> 02:45.050
Delicious!

02:46.030 --> 02:47.190
Ouch!

02:48.160 --> 02:51.220
I told you to watch over the turkey!

02:52.030 --> 02:53.870
All right.

02:53.870 --> 02:54.860
And...

02:56.000 --> 02:57.340
Oh no!

02:58.340 --> 03:00.030
Wait a minute, Dita!

03:01.810 --> 03:04.110
What's all the commotion about?

03:04.110 --> 03:06.150
It's a Christmas high.

03:06.150 --> 03:11.350
Women get high like
that come December 24th.

03:11.350 --> 03:12.820
I see.

03:12.820 --> 03:15.690
You guys don't know
about Christmas at all?

03:16.690 --> 03:18.020
Do you?

03:21.200 --> 03:22.760
It's a festival!

03:22.760 --> 03:24.730
Wasn't there one on Tarak, too?

03:24.730 --> 03:26.630
There was a festival, but...

03:30.940 --> 03:33.740
Festivals aren't all that fun a thing.

03:33.740 --> 03:35.010
Right, guys?

03:35.010 --> 03:36.240
Yeah.

03:37.250 --> 03:38.250
Oh!

03:38.250 --> 03:40.080
There you are, Mr. Alie...

03:41.920 --> 03:44.780
Oh, wait! Mr. Alien!

03:46.990 --> 03:47.980
What?

03:49.060 --> 03:51.360
You really don't know what Christmas is?

03:51.360 --> 03:54.100
When I say I don't know, I don't know!

03:54.100 --> 03:55.530
Poor thing.

03:55.530 --> 03:58.630
Men lead such meager existences.

03:58.630 --> 04:01.900
A delicious dinner and sweet cake...

04:01.900 --> 04:03.930
That alone is so wonderful!

04:05.140 --> 04:09.300
W-Well, they say that
life is full of experiences.

04:10.280 --> 04:11.480
This guy...

04:11.480 --> 04:12.610
Hibiki!

04:12.610 --> 04:17.320
If you help out the ladies,
you can find yourself with a feast!

04:17.320 --> 04:19.250
I-I guess I have no choice.

04:19.250 --> 04:22.120
I just happen to be bored,
so I'll help out a bit!

04:28.400 --> 04:29.520
Sheesh...

04:30.530 --> 04:33.270
What the hell do
you want me to do here?

04:33.270 --> 04:36.700
Find the lights to put on the tree.

04:36.700 --> 04:38.370
I didn't know this was here.

04:39.410 --> 04:40.640
Ow...

04:46.950 --> 04:49.620
Wow!

04:49.620 --> 04:50.740
What is this?

04:56.090 --> 04:59.090
It looks like an item
from the colonization era.

04:59.090 --> 05:00.730
Colonization era?

05:00.730 --> 05:01.720
Yes.

05:03.700 --> 05:04.830
Hey, guys.

05:04.830 --> 05:06.270
What is this?

05:15.740 --> 05:17.300
What? What? What is it?

05:26.020 --> 05:27.580
How cute!

05:40.270 --> 05:41.530
What is this?

05:44.010 --> 05:46.440
T-Together with a man...

05:46.440 --> 05:48.100
Y-You're kidding...

05:52.280 --> 05:55.280
Amazing! Amazing! It's amazing!

05:55.280 --> 05:57.550
A small human...

05:57.550 --> 05:59.520
About my size...

06:00.690 --> 06:02.280
A baby...

06:05.630 --> 06:09.230
A-A man and a woman
under the same roof...

06:09.230 --> 06:11.290
It's a tranquilizer. Take it.

06:28.380 --> 06:30.250
Wonderful! Wonderful!

06:31.250 --> 06:33.190
It's just too wonderful!

06:41.730 --> 06:42.830
What?

06:42.830 --> 06:46.270
- An enemy attack?
- No, we don't see anything.

06:46.270 --> 06:48.270
Do we have data on the comet yet?

06:48.270 --> 06:49.260
Y-Yes...

06:53.440 --> 06:56.680
The surface seems to
be completely made of ice.

06:56.680 --> 06:59.550
No artificial objects have been spotted.

06:59.550 --> 07:01.480
What in the world does that mean?

07:03.180 --> 07:04.520
I did it...

07:07.520 --> 07:09.390
So is it impossible after all

07:09.390 --> 07:11.160
to make it snow?

07:11.160 --> 07:12.360
Not yet!

07:12.360 --> 07:15.530
I'll make sure that
we have a white Christmas!

07:15.530 --> 07:16.700
But at this rate,

07:16.700 --> 07:18.930
we won't be in time for the parade.

07:18.930 --> 07:20.370
That's right...

07:20.370 --> 07:22.600
- Then for the first time...
- No!

07:22.600 --> 07:23.970
I can't imagine it!

07:23.970 --> 07:26.640
I refuse to have a Christmas
without snow sculptures!

07:26.640 --> 07:28.580
You say that, but...

07:28.580 --> 07:31.380
Well, I'll see what I can do, though.

07:31.380 --> 07:33.250
What are they doing?

07:33.250 --> 07:34.510
It's a snow machine.

07:36.480 --> 07:41.890
Parfet's trying to make it
snow on the Nirvana just for us.

07:41.890 --> 07:45.660
How considerate of her! Unlike men.

07:45.660 --> 07:48.220
Can't you talk normally?

07:49.230 --> 07:52.070
So, what are you going to give?

07:52.070 --> 07:54.540
- What?
- Your present.

07:54.540 --> 07:57.810
Don't tell me something stupid
like you don't have one ready.

07:57.810 --> 08:02.240
For a woman, this is an
important event for relationships.

08:06.580 --> 08:08.280
It's so annoying.

08:08.280 --> 08:10.480
You're all getting so excited over this...

08:13.590 --> 08:15.090
Geez...

08:15.090 --> 08:16.280
This is so stupid.

08:17.290 --> 08:19.730
It really is a mistake on Parfet's part?

08:19.730 --> 08:21.060
Yes.

08:21.060 --> 08:26.430
Parfet is doing her best
to make it snow for all of us.

08:26.430 --> 08:28.800
Please, don't scold her.

08:28.800 --> 08:30.070
I know.

08:30.070 --> 08:31.470
However...

08:31.470 --> 08:32.540
Vice-captain!

08:32.540 --> 08:36.410
A Christmas without snow
sculptures would be too depressing.

08:37.040 --> 08:38.510
At the rate we're going,

08:38.510 --> 08:41.880
we'll pass by the comet
right at Christmas time.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.850
That should be enough for this year.

08:43.850 --> 08:44.550
But...

08:44.550 --> 08:48.040
If it's outside, all we can
do is just sit and look at it.

08:58.770 --> 09:01.100
Oh? You're not going to the parade?

09:01.100 --> 09:03.800
We can't be caught off
guard at times like this.

09:03.800 --> 09:06.110
I'll go scout the vicinity.

09:06.110 --> 09:09.040
- My, how wonderful of you.
- Manager.

09:10.010 --> 09:12.840
This chair is too big and won't fit...

09:19.490 --> 09:21.280
Mr. Alien?

09:24.860 --> 09:28.560
How about you kick back
and relax for once today?

09:28.560 --> 09:30.060
But still...

09:30.060 --> 09:32.700
Oh, my preparations
still aren't complete.

09:32.700 --> 09:34.790
My, I'm so busy, so busy.

10:04.800 --> 10:07.200
If it's that big,
there won't be any complaints!

10:21.380 --> 10:22.370
What the hell is this?

10:49.780 --> 10:52.770
To think an enemy had
been hiding in here all along.

10:53.780 --> 10:55.820
Missus...

10:55.820 --> 10:58.550
W-What can I do for you today, Pyoro?

10:58.550 --> 11:01.690
You have a small human in there, right?

11:01.690 --> 11:03.690
T-That's right.

11:03.690 --> 11:06.260
And when she separates,
you'll give her a name, right?

11:06.260 --> 11:07.450
Well, yes...

11:08.600 --> 11:11.500
I thought of a name
for the baby in your womb!

11:12.500 --> 11:16.490
Hey, about your name...

11:17.510 --> 11:19.470
How about Pyoro-2?

11:21.480 --> 11:22.970
Well, I don't know...

11:25.450 --> 11:27.550
Oh, I'll do that!

11:27.550 --> 11:30.020
Hey, wait!

11:30.020 --> 11:33.610
I thought Pyoro-2 was a good name...

11:38.660 --> 11:40.590
It's true.

11:40.590 --> 11:42.500
We saw in the records of the past

11:42.500 --> 11:47.130
that men and women were living
together under the same roof.

11:47.130 --> 11:50.940
Well, we're also getting
along well here right now.

11:50.940 --> 11:53.600
So it's not unthinkable.

11:54.640 --> 11:59.550
But before that, I have to finish
my present to everyone right now.

11:59.550 --> 12:02.240
By the way, what about you, Doctor?

12:03.980 --> 12:06.510
You're getting me a present, right?

12:23.240 --> 12:25.670
Come on! Get out of my way, damn it!

12:29.510 --> 12:30.480
Why are you here?

12:35.980 --> 12:37.450
That light...

12:40.990 --> 12:43.190
Hey, did you see that?

12:43.190 --> 12:45.180
There was a nice twinkling light!

12:46.230 --> 12:47.860
- Dita!
- See? Again!

12:47.860 --> 12:50.300
Wow, it's so pretty!

12:50.300 --> 12:53.130
I don't care. Just get it finished!

12:53.130 --> 12:55.570
Sheesh, you're such a...

13:00.980 --> 13:02.480
What are you afraid of?

13:02.480 --> 13:04.510
Why don't you forget
that and use firearms?

13:04.510 --> 13:06.840
Shut up! Don't give me extra pointers!

13:09.280 --> 13:11.990
Captain, there seems
to be something wrong.

13:11.990 --> 13:13.490
Shall we send out scouts?

13:13.490 --> 13:14.890
Captain!

13:22.360 --> 13:25.200
How is it? Isn't it perfect?

13:26.970 --> 13:29.870
The parade will be beginning soon.

13:29.870 --> 13:33.030
All participating crew
should get into position.

13:34.040 --> 13:35.510
Oh no!

13:35.510 --> 13:36.500
Hey, can you...

13:38.110 --> 13:39.410
Huh?

13:39.410 --> 13:40.880
Hey, where's the doctor?

13:40.880 --> 13:43.680
Dunno. He went off somewhere.

13:43.680 --> 13:44.950
Geez...

13:44.950 --> 13:48.410
Men are useless when
you really need them.

13:48.960 --> 13:51.330
Now, what to do...

13:51.330 --> 13:55.630
We don't have the habit of
giving presents on Tarak.

13:55.630 --> 13:57.260
What'll you do, Duero?

13:59.330 --> 14:01.630
You sound rather confident.

14:03.600 --> 14:05.370
I, on the other hand,

14:05.370 --> 14:08.860
have had a grandpa pound
manners perfectly into me!

14:09.480 --> 14:12.250
That unfounded confidence...

14:12.250 --> 14:14.810
...sometimes makes me jealous.

14:17.620 --> 14:19.140
Damn it! Damn it!

14:25.260 --> 14:26.890
Shut up!

14:29.200 --> 14:30.360
Serves you right!

14:32.830 --> 14:34.840
It really is...

14:34.840 --> 14:36.000
...beautiful.

14:40.170 --> 14:42.610
Where did Mr. Alien go?

14:42.610 --> 14:44.910
All right! Just wait a little more!

14:47.150 --> 14:49.650
Could it be that those two

14:49.650 --> 14:52.410
are inside that comet? Impossible.

15:03.760 --> 15:05.170
Hibiki! Meia!

15:05.170 --> 15:06.830
Where are you? Respond!

15:10.640 --> 15:12.340
Mr. Alien!

15:12.340 --> 15:13.740
Where did you go?

15:16.480 --> 15:18.610
Don't hide!

15:18.610 --> 15:19.810
Come out!

15:20.810 --> 15:22.010
You're not here?

15:29.590 --> 15:30.580
Whoa!

15:32.530 --> 15:34.460
What are you planning?

15:34.460 --> 15:36.090
It's what you call a present.

15:39.400 --> 15:42.300
It's finally time
for the main event now!

15:42.300 --> 15:45.760
Everyone, please gather
at the center of the bio-park.

15:46.770 --> 15:48.210
I won't make it.

15:48.210 --> 15:49.470
It's a shame.

15:51.180 --> 15:55.080
Doctor, I'm sorry, but
the snow won't be in time.

15:55.080 --> 15:57.740
I wanted to show it to you, too...

15:58.720 --> 16:02.220
Actually, mine is rather
incomplete as well, but...

16:02.220 --> 16:03.190
What?

16:08.430 --> 16:09.420
This way!

16:24.880 --> 16:26.250
This won't be long.

16:26.250 --> 16:28.580
Let's hurry up and get the hell back!

16:28.580 --> 16:29.570
I agree.

16:36.020 --> 16:38.130
Wow! Beautiful!

16:38.130 --> 16:39.590
Amazing!

16:39.590 --> 16:41.490
I wonder if Mr. Alien sees this too?

16:42.500 --> 16:43.460
What's wrong?

16:43.460 --> 16:45.370
The countdown's going to begin!

16:45.370 --> 16:46.770
You should hurry up, too!

16:46.770 --> 16:48.600
- We'll be waiting!
- See you later!

16:48.600 --> 16:49.870
Yeah.

16:49.870 --> 16:53.070
I wonder where Mr. Alien went?

16:53.070 --> 16:54.070
Meia.

16:54.070 --> 16:55.060
Respond!

17:02.250 --> 17:03.650
Vice-captain...

17:05.890 --> 17:07.320
It's finally time...

17:07.320 --> 17:08.190
Pyoro-2...

17:12.030 --> 17:15.230
10 seconds until Merry Christmas!

17:15.230 --> 17:16.330
- 9!
- Well...

17:16.330 --> 17:17.460
8!

17:17.460 --> 17:19.200
7! 6!

17:19.200 --> 17:20.830
- 5 seconds!
- Mr. Alien...

17:20.830 --> 17:21.840
4!

17:21.840 --> 17:22.900
3!

17:22.900 --> 17:24.940
- 2! 1!
- It's now or never!

17:24.940 --> 17:25.910
0!

17:25.910 --> 17:27.900
Merry Christmas!

17:33.780 --> 17:34.770
No good...

17:38.320 --> 17:41.480
- There!
- We've got plenty left!

17:53.530 --> 17:54.970
Mr. Alien!

17:57.840 --> 17:59.500
This is as far as I'll go.

18:02.940 --> 18:04.210
I've repaid the favor.

18:07.950 --> 18:09.280
Mr. Alien...

18:11.120 --> 18:14.220
So those two had gone out to get ice.

18:14.220 --> 18:16.120
We don't need these anymore.

18:22.560 --> 18:23.890
I did it!

18:25.030 --> 18:26.130
What's this?

18:26.130 --> 18:28.000
Could it be something for me?

18:28.000 --> 18:29.200
Oh, yes.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.740
Really?

18:30.740 --> 18:32.800
I tried to draw the flow of blood.

18:33.640 --> 18:35.710
If you say that this is snow...

18:35.710 --> 18:38.700
...then the snow inside the
painting will fall forever.

18:41.920 --> 18:43.620
Thanks.

18:43.620 --> 18:45.090
Oh, a scoop!

18:45.090 --> 18:46.350
Pai-check!

18:48.590 --> 18:51.060
This is our company's best item,
7 color pellets.

18:51.060 --> 18:52.860
Thanks. I'll take it.

18:59.570 --> 19:00.970
Is there anything you want?

19:00.970 --> 19:03.040
Huh? N-Not really...

19:03.040 --> 19:04.590
- I'll go now.
- Fine.

19:07.110 --> 19:08.800
Check in the nick of time!

19:13.350 --> 19:14.940
Here. Merry Christmas.

19:16.820 --> 19:18.340
I love you, Barnette!

19:19.620 --> 19:22.210
This is my present to you.

19:23.060 --> 19:24.790
What? That's it?

19:27.900 --> 19:30.690
There are still presents left, everyone.

19:31.470 --> 19:32.530
Captain.

19:32.530 --> 19:36.040
It looks like you can't catch
maidens with only toys now.

19:36.040 --> 19:38.330
What's this... How boring...

19:40.470 --> 19:42.910
Oh, little one, what's wrong?

19:45.180 --> 19:47.240
Nothing at all...

19:48.320 --> 19:51.610
Mr. Alien! Mr. Alien! Mr. Alien!

19:52.850 --> 19:53.890
Here, take it.

19:53.890 --> 19:57.260
I wanted you to open
it right at midnight, but...

19:57.260 --> 19:58.220
Here.

19:59.160 --> 20:00.680
Most of it melted, but...

20:06.130 --> 20:07.120
Wow...

20:09.740 --> 20:10.900
I'm so happy.

20:12.210 --> 20:13.200
Mr. Alie...

20:18.150 --> 20:19.130
Thank you.

20:25.490 --> 20:28.050
Oh no!

20:29.860 --> 20:31.120
Geez...

20:32.590 --> 20:35.560
I missed out on the
feast while I was asleep.

20:39.930 --> 20:40.920
I guess I'll take a look.

20:41.570 --> 20:43.940
Merry Christmas! Merry Christmas!

20:43.940 --> 20:45.630
Merry Christmas!

20:47.510 --> 20:48.910
Santa Alien!

20:52.250 --> 20:54.150
What's this? Idiot...

20:58.990 --> 21:01.690
We were able to live
through another year.

21:01.690 --> 21:02.790
Yes.

21:02.790 --> 21:05.260
A lot happened, but it's all right.

21:05.260 --> 21:06.730
If we were on Mejale,

21:06.730 --> 21:09.800
then we wouldn't have
been able to see this.

21:09.800 --> 21:11.290
There. Take a look.

21:12.470 --> 21:14.490
It's a beautiful thing.

21:15.100 --> 21:18.730
It's like a Christmas tree
in the middle of space...

21:32.190 --> 21:37.790
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.790 --> 21:43.300
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.300 --> 21:49.540
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.540 --> 21:59.850
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.850 --> 22:02.380
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.380 --> 22:14.160
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.160 --> 22:25.770
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.770 --> 22:37.580
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.580 --> 22:51.450
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
